# The sequencer's tricks (SEL + a knob): K1 fills the lane with a Euclidean pattern of n hits in 16, K2 turns it round, K3 sets the lane's probability (a hit sounds
# that often). Here the kick (the lane that is first): eight hits are every other step; turned one on, the other ones; 80 percent.
seed 0
wait 3000
press SEQ
wait 500
release SEQ
expect view 29
expect lane0 0x1111
press SEL
spin K1 -16
spin K1 8
release SEL
wait 50
expect lane0 0x5555
press SEL
spin K2 1
release SEL
wait 50
expect lane0 0xAAAA
press SEL
spin K3 -4
release SEL
wait 50
expect par106 80
shot seq_tricks.png
